# State Management Folder Naming

**Rule:** When a feature contains real logic, separate UI, Bloc/Cubit and State into their own files. Name the folder that holds the state-management classes according to what is used:
- If a `Cubit` is used, name the folder `cubit/`.
- If a `Bloc` is used, name the folder `bloc/`.

Do not put the Bloc/State/Widget in one file, and do not name a folder `bloc/` while it contains a Cubit.

### ❌ Bad Example
```text
lib/feature/home/widget/recent_search/
  ├── bloc/                       # folder says bloc/ ...
  │   ├── recent_search_cubit.dart  # ... but it holds a Cubit
  │   └── recent_search_state.dart
```

### ✅ Good Example
```text
lib/feature/home/recent_search/
  ├── cubit/
  │   ├── recent_search_cubit.dart
  │   └── recent_search_state.dart
  └── recent_search_section.dart
```
